From 44eb555790f6ecf02aa7dac5e564b5a369c7922e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 21:14:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 184/189] Patch 0184: battle speed. R2 in a battle switches x1
 / x2 (40 ticks a second, one render a tick); held at x1 with the item menu
 open, an item in hand or the defeat countdown running; a finisher charge
 press counts twice at x2; the play time counts real time; a plate in the
 corner shows R2 x1 / x2

---
 include/dw/btl.h         |  3 ++
 include/dw/mod_present.h |  7 +++
 src/btl/battle_hud.c     | 97 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/btl/battle_main.c    |  2 +
 src/main/clock.c         |  2 +
 src/main/main.c          | 24 +++++++++-
 6 files changed, 132 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

